    intro: "Mark Manson's The Subtle Art of Not Giving a F*ck: A Counterintuitive Approach to Living a Good Life (2016) is a deliberately profane, contrarian self-help book that argues — against the positivity-focused mainstream of the genre — that choosing what to care about, and accepting the inherent limitations and trade-offs of life, is more fundamental to well-being than the pursuit of happiness or success.",
